# Files that live in the repository but must not be published as static assets.
# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the build output directory (the repo
# root) and skips every matching path. The site itself needs none of these:
# `functions/` is compiled into the Pages Functions worker, and the rest is
# tooling/documentation.

/functions
/wrangler.toml
/schema.sql
/server.py
/README.md
/SETUP.md
/replit.md
/.gitignore
/.agents
/.replit
